abstract: "Code, processed station data, CMIP6 auxiliary training contexts, full prediction tables, and model checkpoints for a physics-deep learning hybrid framework that predicts custom 30-day and 90-day standardized water-balance drought indices and flash-drought early-risk probabilities across eight Jinsha River Basin stations."
